@startuml
title Billing (Razorpay) — as-built: checkout + webhook lifecycle (backend ready, UI absent)

actor "OWNER" as U
participant "app UI\n(connect_shopify_screen)" as App
participant "billing handler\n(billing.go)" as H
participant "BillingService" as Svc
participant "Razorpay API\n(razorpay_client.go)" as RZP
database "billing_subscriptions / users" as DB

== Checkout (backend complete; NO UI entry — D1) ==
U -> App : tap "Upgrade"
note right of App : connect_shopify_screen.dart:523 = TODO,\nno billing screen -> checkout UNREACHABLE (D1)
App -> H : POST /api/v1/billing/checkout {plan}
H -> Svc : CreateCheckout(user, plan)
Svc -> RZP : find/create customer ; CreateSubscription (TotalCount=120 ~10y)
Svc -> DB : persist billing_subscription (status CREATED, short_url)
Svc --> H : {subscription_id, short_url}
H --> App : short_url (Razorpay hosted checkout)
U -> RZP : completes payment on hosted page

== Webhook (backend complete, tested) ==
RZP -> H : POST /webhooks/razorpay  (X-Razorpay-Signature)
H -> RZP : VerifyWebhookSignature(body, sig, secret)\nHMAC-SHA256 + hmac.Equal (constant-time)
alt invalid signature
  H --> RZP : reject
end
H -> Svc : HandleWebhookEvent(event)
Svc -> Svc : dispatch subscription.activated/charged/pending/halted/cancelled
alt activated
  Svc -> DB : status ACTIVE + period ; user.PlanTier = STARTER/PRO
else cancelled
  Svc -> DB : status CANCELLED ; user.PlanTier = FREE (IMMEDIATE, no grace, D3)
else halted
  Svc -> DB : status HALTED (no OWNER-facing dunning notice, D4)
end
H --> RZP : always 200 (avoid retry spam)

note over Svc,DB
  Plan enforcement wired: members (1/3/10), SSO (PRO), webhooks (STARTER+PRO),
  AI insights (PRO). Prices USD $249/$499 on India-centric Razorpay (currency Q, D2).
  Billing initializes only if RAZORPAY_KEY_ID set.
end note
@enduml
